 {
  "name": "count_by",
  "description": "Exact counts of Log Entries grouped by Component, level, node, rack, midplane, alert_tag (BGL), source_file\n    or instance_id (OpenStack), or by dataset, over the whole Base Corpus or one Dataset, with optional full-text\n    and time/Component/level filters. Use this to say HOW OFTEN something occurs. Counts are Log Entries, not\n    incidents. Output: top `limit` groups by count, total_entries over all groups, Evidence (total_count = number\n    of groups; truncated if more groups than returned).",
  "inputSchema": {
   "type": "object",
   "properties": {
